<title>BELGIUM: TENNIS-BELGIUM AND DENMARK LEVEL 1-1 IN DAVIS CUP TIE.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-BELGIUM AND DENMARK LEVEL 1-1 IN DAVIS CUP TIE.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgium and Denmark were level</p>
<p>1-1 after Friday's opening singles in their Davis Cup</p>
<p>Europe-Africa zone group one, second round tie.</p>
<p>Results (Belgian names first):</p>
<p>Filip Dewulf beat Kenneth Carlssen 6-4 6-0 6-1</p>
<p>Johan Van Herck lost to Frederik Fetterlein 6-7 (5-7) 6-2 2-6</p>
<p>1-6</p>
</text>
